    {
      "path": "docs/VERIFICATION-PLAN.md",
      "anchor": "#e1--what-a-sealed-vacuum-cell-actually-weighs",
      "line": 166,
      "text": "member in BENDING as well as a strut in compression**; the bending case is the one that\n  governs, and it had never been tested because it had never been computed.",
      "sha256": "113e3f4c522df0719b2990c6aac125c3490d414e766c4133ddb672b1e8bc618c",
      "kind": "HISTORICAL_PUBLISHED_GOVERNING_CASE_INTENT; old proposed printed article, not selected actual loading",
      "adoption_status": "NO_ADOPTION_MADE_BY_THIS_PAPER; source context only, not instructions or observed evidence"
    },
    {
      "path": "docs/VERIFICATION-PLAN.md",
      "anchor": "#e5--the-level-2-coefficient-ab",
      "line": 218,
      "text": "Could equal-mass, equal-length compression tests of a plain tube and a tube whose wall contains smaller tubes establish the model\u2019s failure-load ratio?",
      "sha256": "3db319cf32f0d8edd08180e2e153d1577de6c56f58d4d9597ecca459001d63e8",
      "kind": "HISTORICAL_PUBLISHED_COMPONENT_COMPARISON_QUESTION; not a test recommendation",
      "adoption_status": "NO_ADOPTION_MADE_BY_THIS_PAPER; source context only, not instructions or observed evidence"
    },
    {
      "path": "docs/VERIFICATION-PLAN.md",
      "anchor": "#e5--the-level-2-coefficient-ab",
      "line": 215,
      "text": "This is a formula without a drawn hierarchical strut, as the [float ledger](FLOAT-LEDGER.md) records.",
      "sha256": "9c2b8acd0c7f3c9ef2ebe940ca70c3123a466a16e18d12fd91016032ea0aef0f",
      "kind": "PUBLISHED_FORMULA_GEOMETRY_LIMIT; not measured member or assembly evidence",
      "adoption_status": "NO_ADOPTION_MADE_BY_THIS_PAPER; source context only, not instructions or observed evidence"
    },
    {
      "path": "docs/VERIFICATION-PLAN.md",
      "anchor": "#e5--the-level-2-coefficient-ab",
      "line": 217,
      "text": "Which measured knockdowns apply to this geometry?",
      "sha256": "3d3abe59f7e21524802efc1ee307f7ede1536b1e5635f0dc6f882902e1675c72",
      "kind": "PUBLISHED_UNRESOLVED_APPLICABILITY_QUESTION; no coefficient adopted",
      "adoption_status": "NO_ADOPTION_MADE_BY_THIS_PAPER; source context only, not instructions or observed evidence"
    },
    {
      "path": "docs/VERIFICATION-PLAN.md",
      "anchor": "#e1--what-a-sealed-vacuum-cell-actually-weighs",
      "line": 144,
      "text": "**Stage B is now a concrete article: the printed demonstrator.**",
      "sha256": "fa9ddee889ac0287cc2db939c0d06e7d25d9836cf2c1f7ab4b37e45a5a612cc0",
      "kind": "HISTORICAL_PROPOSED_ARTICLE_CONTEXT; not actual made-article identity",
      "adoption_status": "NO_ADOPTION_MADE_BY_THIS_PAPER; source context only, not instructions or observed evidence"
    },
    {
      "path": "docs/MEMBER-CENSUS.md",
      "anchor": "",
      "line": 76,
      "text": "inner-ring, fan, theta and junction display sections are schematic",
      "sha256": "c734bafec789e2ed49778688fcb53e28c0c42aa293b232f07493af2d0aa6bc73",
      "kind": "CURRENT_PUBLISHED_REPRESENTATION_LIMIT; not matched actual rim boundary or member",
